<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>AuthSphere | Home</title>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%, #6d5dfc, transparent 30%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 80% 70%, #00c6ff, transparent 30%),
                linear-gradient(135deg, #0b1020, #151b35);
            color: white;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .blob {
            position: absolute;
            width: 350px;
            height: 350px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            filter: blur(70px);
            opacity: .45;
            animation: float 8s infinite alternate ease-in-out;
        }

        .blob1 {
            background: #7b2cff;
            top: -100px;
            left: -100px;
        }

        .blob2 {
            background: #00c6ff;
            bottom: -120px;
            right: -80px;
            animation-delay: 2s;
        }

        @keyframes float {
            from {
                transform: translateY(-30px) translateX(-20px);
            }

            to {
                transform: translateY(40px) translateX(30px);
            }
        }

        nav {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 10;
            width: 90%;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 25px 0;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .logo span {
            color: #00d9ff;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: white;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            transition: .3s;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.12);
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }

        .hero {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 5;
            min-height: calc(100vh - 90px);
            width: 90%;
            margin: auto;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 60px;
        }

        .hero-text {
            max-width: 620px;
        }

        .tag {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #b8f3ff;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: clamp(45px, 7vw, 85px);
            line-height: 1.1;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        h1 span {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #00d9ff, #a96cff);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
        }

        .hero-text p {
            color: #c7cbe0;
            font-size: 17px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .btn {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: white;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: .35s;
        }

        .primary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6d5dfc, #00c6ff);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,198,255,.25);
        }

        .secondary {
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25);
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.07);
        }

        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px) scale(1.03);
        }

        .scene {
            perspective: 1200px;
        }

        .card-3d {
            width: 350px;
            height: 430px;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.08);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            box-shadow:
                25px 25px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.3),
                -10px -10px 30px rgba(255,255,255,.04);
            transform: rotateY(-12deg) rotateX(7deg);
            transition: .5s;
            animation: levitate 4s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
        }

        @keyframes levitate {
            from {
                transform: rotateY(-12deg) rotateX(7deg) translateY(-10px);
            }

            to {
                transform: rotateY(-8deg) rotateX(3deg) translateY(20px);
            }
        }

        .card-3d:hover {
            transform: rotateY(0deg) rotateX(0deg) scale(1.04);
        }

        .shield {
            width: 90px;
            height: 90px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            font-size: 42px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00c6ff, #6d5dfc);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0,198,255,.3);
        }

        .card-3d h2 {
            font-size: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .card-3d p {
            color: #c7cbe0;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .features {
            margin-top: 25px;
            display: grid;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .feature {
            padding: 12px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.07);
            border-radius: 12px;
        }

        @media(max-width: 800px) {
            body {
                overflow-y: auto;
            }

            .hero {
                padding: 50px 0;
                flex-direction: column;
                text-align: center;
            }

            .buttons {
                justify-content: center;
            }

            .nav-links {
                display: none;
            }

            .card-3d {
                width: 100%;
                max-width: 350px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="blob blob1"></div>
    <div class="blob blob2"></div>

    <nav>
        <div class="logo">Auth<span>Sphere</span></div>

        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="/login">Login</a>
            <a href="/register">Create Account</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main class="hero">

        <section class="hero-text">
            <div class="tag">✦ Secure Authentication System</div>

            <h1>
                Your Digital Identity,
                <span>Secured.</span>
            </h1>

            <p>
                Experience a modern authentication system powered by
                JWT, secure cookies, encrypted passwords and role-based
                authorization.
            </p>

            <div class="buttons">
                <a href="/register" class="btn primary">
                    Create Account →
                </a>

                <a href="/login" class="btn secondary">
                    Login
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="scene">
            <div class="card-3d">

                <div class="shield">🔐</div>

                <h2>Protected Access</h2>

                <p>
                    Securely authenticate users and control access
                    based on their roles.
                </p>

                <div class="features">
                    <div class="feature">✓ JWT Authentication</div>
                    <div class="feature">✓ Encrypted Passwords</div>
                    <div class="feature">✓ Role Authorization</div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </section>

    </main>

</body>
</html>